# Copy to .env.local for local dev (gitignored). Coolify injects the real
# values in production via its own env config — nothing here is a secret:
# the anon key is RLS-protected, same reasoning as the old app's
# --dart-define. Never put the service-role key in a VITE_* var — that
# would ship it to the browser.

